WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
One flash of light. Two beeps. A viewer may report two flashes.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Researchers documented this sound-induced flash illusion in 2000.
It's a finding about what we perceive—not a magic audio trick.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Its timing and experimental conditions matter.
It doesn't prove a recording can improve your brain.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:35.000
If you're buying meditation audio, check the files,
terms and independent evidence.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Try twelve minutes free first.
Read Final Vestige's source trail.
